<title>MALAYSIA: United Merchant six-mth net up 70 pct.</title>
<headline>United Merchant six-mth net up 70 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>    Net profit		  34.17	vs	20.08</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 10.89	vs	11.06</p>
<p>    Turnover		   286.84     vs    112.18</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    58.75     vs     30.13</p>
<p>    Minorities     less	2.13     vs	nil</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries   loss   0.08     vs loss 0.08</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is United Merchant Group Bhd. The company provides a wide range of financial services.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
